[0]: G3 group sw
[1]: G7 group sw</description>
              <bitRange>[9:8]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>g2_h5L3318_lv</name>
              <description>VDDPST=5V
  H533L18 = 1
  H518L33 = 1
  H5L3318 = 1
VDDPST=3.3V
  H533L18 = 1
  H518L33 = 0
  H5L3318 = 0
VDDPST=1.8V
  H533L18 = 0
  H518L33 = 1
  H5L3318 = 0
when PAD SHUTDOWN, pad will ISO this three value to 111 for safety .</description>
              <bitRange>[16:16]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
