0x1: USB
0x2: DVP
0x3: RMII
0x4: GDMA
And the following shows bit field of each slots:
[2:0]: slot 0 of arbiter
[5:3]: slot 1 of arbiter
[8:6]: slot 2 of arbiter
[11:9]: slot 3 of arbiter
[14:12]: slot 4 of arbiter
[17:15]: slot 5 of arbiter
