Only can be programmed in ctrl mode, user set AMODE=1 to enter asyn mode0 and set AMODE=0 to exit asyn mode0</description>
              <bitRange>[3:3]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>ABUSY</name>
              <description>1: Async mode0 flow is still busy (action Not Over)
0: Async mode0 flow is Not busy</description>
              <bitRange>[2:2]</bitRange>
              <access>read-only</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>BBUSYN</name>
