              <name>RXDA_FIFO_13</name>
              <description>Tag &lt;= 2.2.0
RXDA FIFO index register to read 4-byte data. 
Tag &gt;= 2.2.1
RXDA FIFO index register to read 1-byte data. 
RXDA FIFO is used to read I3C/I2C recevied data.
Support fixed or increased address.
ex: 
1. Fixed address: 0x180 to read data from RXDA FIFO 
2. Increased address: 0x180~0x1BC to read data from RXDA FIFO</description>
              <bitRange>[31:0]</bitRange>
              <access>read-only</access>
            </field>
          </fields>
        </register>
