          <resetMask>0xFFFFFFFF</resetMask>
          <fields>
            <field>
              <name>DATA_MASK_DR_EXTEND0</name>
              <description>It is a extended data buffer for spi_dm[1] signal in user mode when the width of spi_dm is 2-bit (DQ16). The output value of spi_dm[1] is the data that has been pushed to DM_FIFO [1]. If DM_FIFO is empty, the output value of spi_data_en will be (~DM_ACT).
Available only if configuration of DM_EN and DQ16 are defined.</description>
              <bitRange>[1:1]</bitRange>
              <access>write-only</access>
            </field>
            <field>
