01: SEL_TOUCH_CUR_0V2I_1IBHN = 0; EN_TOUCHCUR_CALI = 0 (normal mode)
10: SEL_TOUCH_CUR_0V2I_1IBHN = 0; EN_TOUCHCUR_CALI = 1 (calibration mode)
11: SEL_TOUCH_CUR_0V2I_1IBHN = 1; EN_TOUCHCUR_CALI = 0 (debug mode)</description>
