        <register>
          <name>DVP_DDR_LEN</name>
          <addressOffset>0x00000068</addressOffset>
          <size>32</size>
          <description></description>
          <resetValue>0x00000000</resetValue>
          <resetMask>0xFFFFFFFF</resetMask>
          <fields>
            <field>
              <name>ddr_len</name>
              <description>ddr length, 4 byte align
frame_buffer mode is frame size
ring buffer mode is ring buffer szie
The size of the slave space written by dma, here refers to the size of the psram allocated
YUV MODE
ddr_len配置大小应为frame size
JPG MODE
jpg数据流大小不固定,这里需要保险期间配置大一些,配置大小需要计算jpg的压缩比例和压缩前的图片大小,建议值是压缩比*sensor分辨率
RING BUFFER,FRAME BUFFE共用寄存器
切换方式通过ring_buffer_en进行切换.
ring_buffer_en为1时,ddr_len表示ring buffer length
ring_buffer_en为0时,ddr_len表示frame buffer length</description>
              <bitRange>[23:2]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
          </fields>
        </register>
