        <register>
          <name>DVP_DMA_STATUS</name>
          <addressOffset>0x00000080</addressOffset>
          <size>32</size>
          <description></description>
          <resetValue>0x00000000</resetValue>
          <resetMask>0xFFFFFFFF</resetMask>
          <fields>
            <field>
              <name>frame_status_done3</name>
              <description>frame buffer 3 done
1: frame buffer full
0: frame buffer empty or receiving frame
当frame_end_int中断拉高时,需要读取该寄存器地址,通过bit位置1的位置来得知哪一块frame buffer经过接收完一帧数据.然后software及时去相应的frame buffer取数据,取完数据以后将该bit位写1置0</description>
              <bitRange>[3:3]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>frame_status_done2</name>
              <description>frame buffer 2 done
1: frame buffer full
0: frame buffer empty or receiving frame
当frame_end_int中断拉高时,需要读取该寄存器地址,通过bit位置1的位置来得知哪一块frame buffer经过接收完一帧数据.然后software及时去相应的frame buffer取数据,取完数据以后将该bit位写1置0</description>
              <bitRange>[2:2]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>frame_status_done1</name>
              <description>frame buffer 1 done
1: frame buffer full
0: frame buffer empty or receiving frame
当frame_end_int中断拉高时,需要读取该寄存器地址,通过bit位置1的位置来得知哪一块frame buffer经过接收完一帧数据.然后software及时去相应的frame buffer取数据,取完数据以后将该bit位写1置0</description>
              <bitRange>[1:1]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>frame_status_done0</name>
              <description>frame buffer 0 done
1: frame buffer full
0: frame buffer empty or receiving frame
当frame_end_int中断拉高时,需要读取该寄存器地址,通过bit位置1的位置来得知哪一块frame buffer经过接收完一帧数据.然后software及时去相应的frame buffer取数据,取完数据以后将该bit位写1置0</description>
              <bitRange>[0:0]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
          </fields>
        </register>
      </registers>
